{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1453418,\"title\":\"Bluey at the Cinema: Let's Play Chef Collection\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Bluey at the Cinema: Let’s Play Chef Collection is an hour-long treat for fans of Bluey to enjoy, made up of eight episodes from the TV show’s three series, all based around the fun of food! The compilation will showcase memorable moments such as Takeaway, Fancy Restaurant, and highlight the Heelers' skills in the kitchen with episodes such as Omelette and Duck Cake – cooking has never been so fun!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e1kjHMksWPQrWtV5Yo8bEsU7dsU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hPjL9w0ALwr6O6BokS34CyoXsZX.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"voteCount\":6,\"year\":2025,\"runtime\":54,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"AU\",\"name\":\"Australia\"},{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":698501,\"director\":\"Joe Brumm\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1482514,\"name\":\"Joe Brumm\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lI6AoQnS9eLH5LjXL6GSy8VGPfv.jpg\"},{\"id\":5443454,\"name\":\"Richard Jeffrey\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2139632,\"name\":\"Dave McCormack\",\"character\":\"Bandit Heeler (voice) (archive footage)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tF2Xy0bqOf1C2CQjEX8TL9yuKSA.jpg\"},{\"id\":1312450,\"name\":\"Melanie Zanetti\",\"character\":\"Chilli Heeler (voice) (archive footage)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lbUQ7ilvBtWMU23reKsHg3jRmsf.jpg\"},{\"id\":3351788,\"name\":\"Brad Elliott\",\"character\":\"Lucky's Dad (voice) (archive footage)\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":268899,\"title\":\"Justice League: Starcrossed - The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4euOQztpRoN4vJyH0wwjBCydecb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9K4thh2YEpzjI5LX8AwYzFWGeWu.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the Thanagarians visit Earth, Hawkgirl is forced to choose between loyalty to her people and love for her friends on her adopted planet Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":89221,\"title\":\"The Collected Shorts of Jan Svankmajer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jAlLH0IQuFVIYLOcnLilSCWqhm0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For the past 40 years, Jan Svankmajer (Faust, Conspirators of Pleasure) has been hailed as one of cinema's most consistently surprising, wildly imaginative, and remarkable surrealists of our time. Utilizing a delirious combination of puppets, humans, stop-motion animation, and live action, Svankmajer's films conjure up a dreamlike universe that is at once dark, macabre, witty, and perversely visceral.  KimStim (and Kino) is proud to to offer this collection of remarkable short works from an artist that has mesmerized audiences the world over and has inspired filmmakers from the Brothers Quay to Tim Burton and Terry Gilliam.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20455,\"title\":\"Digimon: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tiH1muonzAWzlLjPhjAcAYVAjzm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1ZFUt0LtYkF568iCkRXCScgBP5g.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a powerful new Internet Digimon hatches and begins to consume data at an alarming rate, the Digidestined - kids chosen to save the digital world - must put an end to the destruction before the damage becomes irreversible and worldwide communication halts forever. As computer-based missiles are launched, and a wayward Digimon kidnaps the Digidestined, only the combined efforts of a worldwide network of kids and a new group of \\\"Digidestined\\\" can rescue the others and stop global disaster.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":734310,\"title\":\"Sesame Street: 50 Years and Counting\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ac5WA1N2MikJj8xIlb53LKQFWys.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A compilation of various segments and plots from the iconic edutainment series' history, with one disc containing 75 individual segments (presented in themed sections) and the other containing nine street plots, including the reveal of Mr. Snuffleupagus, Mr. Hooper's death, Maria and Luis' wedding, and the arrivals of Abby Cadabby and Julia.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":354209,\"title\":\"Here Comes the Mole\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yNz03CqfbOv7I3kTE6MXgOtzNPO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xdSVxch5o4mOfq8qXF7OTo7KVU6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Feature film compiled from the animated short films of Krtek the Mole from 1963-1975.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"zGygNfLvbA0\",\"name\":\"Special Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}